{
  "id": "reading-retired-reenabled",
  "title": "Reading cards are retired by default and come back with the setting (ADR-035)",
  "covers": [
    "cards.reading_retired",
    "cards.reading_reenabled",
    "notes.create_no_reading_card"
  ],
  "narrative": [
    "A vocab note has a meaning and a reading card, both new. cards.reading_enabled is absent, so the reading card is retired.",
    "Step 0: only the meaning card is served and counted.",
    "Step 1: createNote asking for meaning and reading creates only the meaning card.",
    "Step 2: cards.reading_enabled is set true. Step 3: the queue now also holds reading cards that exist; the note of step 1 got no reading card (no backfill).",
    "Step 4: createNote with the setting on creates both cards.",
    "Step 5-6: the setting is turned off again; the queue is as for a replica that never had it on, plus the new notes' meaning cards."
  ],
